{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When Dave walks to school, he averages <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> steps per minute, and each of his steps is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cm long. It takes him <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes to get to school. His brother, Jack, going to the same school by the same route, averages <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> steps per minute, but his steps are only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cm long. How long does it take Jack to get to school?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cbb5ab0eefacf4a2f705e723122a264775d04a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }14 \\frac{2}{9} \\text{minutes} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }15 \\text{minutes}\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 18 \\text{minutes}\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }20 \\text{minutes} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 22 \\frac{2}{9} \\text{minutes}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"697\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> steps per minute and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d12bea2b48bb188826a204c5fa4de7a07a66181b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75 cm$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" /> per step, Dave walks at a rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d223d5af290aaecbbbf8d9d46f6db08559229cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90\\times75$\" width=\"58\" height=\"12\" /> cm per minute, and with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes, the distance Dave walks to school is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/d/7bdf3aa6c0be01d7285e7e869b3d27862f0b1f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90\\times75\\times16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"13\" />. Also, at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> steps per minute and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cm per step, Jack walks at a rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/1/9c1e6074c5816e2a6dd63ef2be94e9c6785e6eb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\times60$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" /> cm per minute. Jack must walk <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/d/7bdf3aa6c0be01d7285e7e869b3d27862f0b1f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90\\times75\\times16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"13\" /> cm, so it takes him <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/8/d28959c122795d656424a5acd8efde639868b8e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{90\\times75\\times16}{100\\times60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" /> minutes. Canceling some of the factors, this comes out to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/0/7000271f3dcd5b4fb4949bccb200de3937c845dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18 \\text{minutes}, \\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti